settle 20
act Search saved sources
type m5-scope-check
wait-research-search 600
choose-suggestion Structured records…
choose-suggestion Run in this scope
wait-structured-result 600
record-structured-research prior_result
choose-suggestion Back to search
choose-suggestion Search options…
choose-suggestion Sources and scope
choose-suggestion Choose sources
capture scope_selector
choose-suggestion Back
choose-suggestion Back to results
settle 60
capture scope_result
record-saved-sources scope_result
wait-research-search 600
assert event m5-intentional-diagnostic-stop
